<title>USA: Miss. $111 mln GOs won by JP Morgan at 5.4738 pct TIC. [CORRECTED 16:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Miss. $111 mln GOs won by JP Morgan at 5.4738 pct TIC. [CORRECTED 16:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc (Corrects from Merrill Lynch &amp; Co) said Wednesday it won $111 million Mississippi general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.4738 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects TIC from 5.478 percent).</p>
</text>
